# react-spectrum-charts conventions

## Tooling
- Use yarn. Never npm or pnpm.
- Node 20 (per .nvmrc).
- Tests: Jest with TZ=UTC. Run targeted: `yarn test --testPathPattern=<component>`.
- Storybook on port 6009 (`yarn storybook`).

## Code
- Every new file needs the Apache 2.0 copyright header. Run `yarn copyrights` if unsure.
- Follow existing patterns. If you'd introduce a new pattern, ask first.

## Type 1 props (plain-value props on existing components)
- Update the type in BOTH `vega-spec-builder` AND `vega-spec-builder-s2` for S2 parity.
- Type 1 props flow through the adapter spread — no adapter change needed.
- Update the React component, format utils (with tests), and a Storybook story.
